11        `Collection method contribution "${contribution.id}" failed for model "${view.name}".`,
12        {
13          why: "The ORM client asks every contribution for every model's methods when it is created.",
14          fix: `Fix or remove the extension that contributes "${contribution.id}"; the cause is the contribution's own error.`,
